      "id": "claim_0cc30e330c1e4815a415b277f42be5fb",
      "statement": "withRetry retries the whole scoring pipeline with exponential backoff (default 3 attempts, 100ms base) and throws a ScoringPipelineError on exhaustion; its only caller is computeWordScoresForRound in publishRoundSummary.ts, which wraps executeScoringPipeline so transient round-scoring failures are retried.",
